Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot the head, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the hell you did with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what the Widow wants with an idiot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,until you've fixed it.
